'''Frozen Rose Cat''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[White Day Capsules (Gacha Event)|White Day]] gacha event. It was added in [[Version 13.2 Update|Version 13.2]], and is the White Day variant of [[Ice Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Ice Cat]].

